{"asset": "261108-img-3610-59ba", "model": "small.en", "language": "en", "createdAt": "2026-11-09T02:59:15+00:00", "segments": [{"start": 12.05, "end": 19.07, "text": "I'm at 4.3 watts per kilo. The goal is five. Episode number one of road to five watts per kilo is me failing a workout"}, {"start": 23.09, "end": 26.77, "text": "Watts per kilo simply put is how hard you can push for your size"}, {"start": 28.96, "end": 37.81, "text": "It's really the only number that matters when you're going uphill. I'm at 4.3 watts per kilo. The goal is five"}, {"start": 37.81, "end": 42.45, "text": "episode one of road to five watts per kilo is"}, {"start": 42.45, "end": 43.55, "text": "me failing a workout"}, {"start": 44.97, "end": 48.27, "text": "I'm at 4.3 watts per kilo. The goal is five"}, {"start": 48.79, "end": 55.53, "text": "episode 1 of Road to 5 watts per kilo is me failing a workout watts per kilo is"}, {"start": 55.53, "end": 61.15, "text": "basically how hard you can push for your size this is really the one number that"}, {"start": 61.15, "end": 98.05, "text": "matters for going uphill like these guys do in the Tour de France this workout"}, {"start": 98.05, "end": 103.25, "text": "started great I had taken my calf gel I had my carb mix everything was going fine"}, {"start": 103.75, "end": 109.07, "text": "the first interval I went out a little bit hard at around 340 watts then the"}, {"start": 109.07, "end": 114.77, "text": "Second interval hit and to pass a couple people before a corner I bumped it up to 400 watts"}, {"start": 115.33, "end": 117.49, "text": "and my power didn't come down."}, {"start": 118.71, "end": 125.39, "text": "I averaged just about 345 for that interval, much higher than the middle of the pack of"}, {"start": 125.39, "end": 125.95, "text": "my target."}, {"start": 127.37, "end": 135.77, "text": "I averaged 345 watts for that interval, quite a bit higher than the middle of my target zone"}, {"start": 135.77, "end": 147.42, "text": "which was 318 to 350 after going out so hard on the second one the third one came around then the"}, {"start": 147.42, "end": 158.16, "text": "fourth one and i was cooked i was doing i think it was 320 then damn near 310 for the last interval"}, {"start": 158.16, "end": 169.71, "text": "much much lower than my ftp which is right around 340 that 400 watt jump as well as starting much"}, {"start": 178.26, "end": 183.56, "text": "Bumping up the power to 400 watts in that second interval and going harder than I normally do"}, {"start": 183.56, "end": 191.31, "text": "in the first and second is really what took a toll on me in that session and it happens"}, {"start": 191.31, "end": 200.49, "text": "not every workout has to be perfect but we take on the lesson that it's gonna be okay"}, {"start": 221.81, "end": 226.23, "text": "going out so hard on the second and the first intervals was kind of my pitfall but it was"}, {"start": 226.23, "end": 233.21, "text": "This is also 74 degrees and nearly 100% humidity, which is a far cry from the chilly 65 degree"}, {"start": 233.21, "end": 234.73, "text": "mornings I've been working with recently."}, {"start": 238.94, "end": 244.86, "text": "This duplicate, this tough duo hit pretty hard, and I ended up failing the workout."}, {"start": 247.4, "end": 252.34, "text": "This is a nice reminder that even though I started cycling just over a year ago, it's"}, {"start": 252.34, "end": 255.78, "text": "not all sunshines and rainbows, and sometimes you do indeed fail a workout."}, {"start": 256.7, "end": 260.72, "text": "The progress is not linear but the progress is upwards and that's all that matters."}, {"start": 267.14, "end": 270.14, "text": "This week I'm going to hit the workouts a little harder and pace them."}, {"start": 272.57, "end": 274.13, "text": "This week I'm going to pace them."}, {"start": 277.12, "end": 279.64, "text": "This week the workouts should flow a little nicer."}, {"start": 280.06, "end": 281.24, "text": "Follow along to watch it happen."}, {"start": 282.64, "end": 285.2, "text": "This week the workouts should flow a little nicer."}, {"start": 285.8, "end": 286.92, "text": "Follow along to watch it happen."}], "words": [{"w": "I'm", "s": 12.05, "e": 12.53, "p": 0.667}, {"w": "at", "s": 12.53, "e": 12.61, "p": 0.987}, {"w": "4.3", "s": 12.61, "e": 13.27, "p": 0.973}, {"w": "watts", "s": 13.27, "e": 13.37, "p": 0.792}, {"w": "per", "s": 13.37, "e": 13.61, "p": 0.97}, {"w": "kilo.", "s": 13.61, "e": 14.03, "p": 0.993}, {"w": "The", "s": 14.25, "e": 14.35, "p": 0.982}, {"w": "goal", "s": 14.35, "e": 14.53, "p": 0.992}, {"w": "is", "s": 14.53, "e": 14.75, "p": 0.997}, {"w": "five.", "s": 14.75, "e": 15.03, "p": 0.579}, {"w": "Episode", "s": 15.85, "e": 15.93, "p": 0.918}, {"w": "number", "s": 15.93, "e": 16.17, "p": 0.913}, {"w": "one", "s": 16.17, "e": 16.53, "p": 0.939}, {"w": "of", "s": 16.53, "e": 16.89, "p": 0.977}, {"w": "road", "s": 16.89, "e": 17.01, "p": 0.48}, {"w": "to", "s": 17.01, "e": 17.25, "p": 0.79}, {"w": "five", "s": 17.25, "e": 17.33, "p": 0.847}, {"w": "watts", "s": 17.33, "e": 17.51, "p": 0.971}, {"w": "per", "s": 17.51, "e": 17.71, "p": 0.998}, {"w": "kilo", "s": 17.71, "e": 18.07, "p": 0.998}, {"w": "is", "s": 18.07, "e": 18.25, "p": 0.91}, {"w": "me", "s": 18.25, "e": 18.41, "p": 0.919}, {"w": "failing", "s": 18.41, "e": 18.69, "p": 0.969}, {"w": "a", "s": 18.69, "e": 18.81, "p": 0.971}, {"w": "workout", "s": 18.81, "e": 19.07, "p": 0.982}, {"w": "Watts", "s": 23.09, "e": 23.57, "p": 0.002}, {"w": "per", "s": 23.57, "e": 23.79, "p": 0.987}, {"w": "kilo", "s": 23.79, "e": 24.21, "p": 0.996}, {"w": "simply", "s": 24.21, "e": 24.53, "p": 0.457}, {"w": "put", "s": 24.53, "e": 24.87, "p": 0.989}, {"w": "is", "s": 24.87, "e": 25.19, "p": 0.875}, {"w": "how", "s": 25.19, "e": 25.41, "p": 0.997}, {"w": "hard", "s": 25.41, "e": 25.65, "p": 0.998}, {"w": "you", "s": 25.65, "e": 25.77, "p": 0.999}, {"w": "can", "s": 25.77, "e": 25.87, "p": 0.998}, {"w": "push", "s": 25.87